  "instructions": [
    "Preheat a non-stick skillet or griddle over medium heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together almond flour, salt, black pepper, and dried thyme.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together eggs, milk, mushroom broth, and melted butter.",
    "Add the wet ingredients to the dry ingredients and stir until just combined.",
    "Fold in the dehydrated banana.",
    "Using a 1/4 cup measuring cup, scoop the batter onto the preheated skillet or griddle.",
    "Cook the pancakes for 2-3 minutes, until bubbles appear on the surface and the edges start to dry.",
    "Flip the pancakes and cook for an additional 1-2 minutes, until golden brown."
  ],
